0..80 Comment "// A signature stated over a finite shape. The member `shape Square : 4 { … }`"
81..159 Comment "// names the shape the signature\'s cells are stated over and the faces of it a"
160..238 Comment "// cell may be fixed on, each the subshape of the points it lists (Schönlank,"
239..316 Comment "// Nuyts and Devriese, _Towards FaceTT_, TYPES 2026: the shape parameter `ft`"
317..395 Comment "// and its subshapes). The member\'s spelling is provisional. The block\'s value"
396..475 Comment "// codes the shape at the head of its sort chain, so a program reads it back by"
476..486 Comment "// `case`."
